This directory contains derived coefficient tables generated from the SADIE II
Database (University of York, release v2-2, 2024-06-18), subject D2 (KEMAR),
using the Sonitude preparation script `tools/hrtf/prepare_hrtf.py`.

Original dataset reference:
- Armstrong, C., Thresh, L., Kearney, G. "A Perceptual Evaluation of
  Individual and Non-Individual HRTFs: A Case Study of the SADIE II
  Database", DOI: 10.3390/app8112029
- Zenodo dataset DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.12092466

License:
- Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE file in this directory).

Change notice:
- Azimuth convention converted to Sonitude head frame
  (sonitude_az = normalize(-sadie_az)).
- Horizontal-plane subset sampled at 5 degree azimuth steps.
- Compact candidate tables derived at 16/32/64 taps.
